# Grist's −2 after Grist has left the battlefield (the ruling): Bot2 bolts her (loyalty 1) in response, and as the
# ability resolves Bot1 still may sacrifice a creature, and when it does the reflexive trigger destroys a target
# creature: here Bot1's other Llanowar Elves, since Bot2 has none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bayou x3
Grist, the Hunger Tide
Llanowar Elves x2
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#1.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#2.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#1.Activate(Ability: Add {B})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#2.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#3.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Activate(Ability: sacrifice)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves#1)
[T5 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Llanowar Elves; Grist, the Hunger Tide
Bot1.Battlefield = Bayou; Bayou; Bayou
